            <div class="banner-logo-wrap"><img src="Assets/images/banners/maxload-logo.svg" alt=""></div>
            <h1 class="text-h1 text-white">The strength behind tomorrow's landmarks</h1>
            <p class="hero-para">
              MAXLOAD is designed for demanding applications where durability, load-bearing capacity, and performance cannot be compromised.
            </p>
            
          </div>
        </div>
          <div class="outer-hero-button outer-bg-white">
            <a class="site-link" href="#">
              Read the full story
              <span class="site-link-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><img src="Assets/images/common-images/button-arrow-icon.svg" alt="" class="w-auto object-cover"></span>
